{
  "file" : "npc/quests/skills/thief_skills.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 21,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 22,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "As you live life you will encounter"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 23,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "many things. Sometimes you will"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 24,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "not understand and wonder why some"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 25,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "things are so important. You may consider it"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 26,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "as useless knowledge, but it isn't"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 27,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "Let me explain."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 29,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "Sand Attack"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 29,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "Back Slide"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 29,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "Find Stone"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 29,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "Stone Fling"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 29,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "I will be back later."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "Luckily, you have brought some"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "sand with you. It is very important"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "to a thief to have a small quantity at"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "all times. Most people do not"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "realize the value of such a common"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "substance."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "In case you meet a powerful"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "monster in a dungeon with no"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "sand, you could use this sand to"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "blind the monster and flee."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "You should have a special sand pocket."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "What? You don't expect me to"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "do that for you as well do you?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "You must be very lazy! ! !"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "Very well, find the one named"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "RuRumuni. He will make you a"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "sturdy leather pocket."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 58,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "I will be preparing for your"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "return. Find RuRumuni in"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "west Payon. That is where I"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "heard he is these days."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "The most important part"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "of being a good thief is stealth."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "A thief should never be seen or"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "touched unless he wants to."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "Some consider this cowardly"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 72,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "but I think differently."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "The way I see it, we live in a"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "world where survival of the fittest"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "rules our lives. "
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "They may think less of me for use"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "this special skill. . . What is this skill?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "This is the sand blinding skill."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "If you can throw or kick sand"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "in the eyes of your opponent,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "not only does their defense decrease,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "but their ability to attack is impaired."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "It is so effective, you may even stun them."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "Well, we have to survive too."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "Its either us or them. . ."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 92,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "I think it is important and vital"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "that we prepare a little sand."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 94,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "What do you think? If you like it "
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "go and get five Fine Grit."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "I am sure you eager to learn this"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "skill, but you must first gather five Fine Grit"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "Until you have gathered them,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "I cannot teach you this skill."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 102,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "Don't be disappointed, hurry and gather them."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 104,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 105,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "Oh, I almost forgot! ! !"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "If you want to learn this "
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "special skill, be sure that"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "you are sufficiently experienced"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "to use this properly. This means"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "you should be at least job level 25."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 113,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "Go to west payon and find"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "RuRumuni. He will make you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "fine durable pouch for your"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "sand."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "I will take these five Fine Grit"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "and prepare them for you while I wait."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 124,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "Okay! Great !!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "What a fine pouch indeed!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 127,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "Small and easy to carry, with enough"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 128,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "capacity for enough sand. "
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 129,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "This is a perfect ^3355FFLeather Bag of Infinity^000000 !!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "for you to use with this skill."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 132,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "Well let's see what your skill"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 134,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "is like -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "Try it out ! !"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "AHhh, watch out for my eyes !!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 139,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "^5533FF- *throwing sand* -^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 141,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "^5533FF- *tossing sand* -^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 143,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "Hoo Hoo Hoo... You are a"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 145,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "natural! ! ! Excellent !"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 146,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "I guess I have nothing more"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 147,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "that I can teach you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 148,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "I hope that this skill will"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 149,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "aid you in the future. -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 157,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "Okay! Let's practice!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 159,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 160,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "Suuu Suuu uk -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 162,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 163,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "Suuuuk - -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 165,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 166,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "Suk - Suuuk - - -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 168,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 169,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "Great! -At this level,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 170,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "I am sure you can increase"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 171,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "your skill on your own."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 176,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 177,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "Usually we like to think about"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 178,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "attacking and damage, but"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 179,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "it is important to realize that"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 180,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "fleeing is just as important"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 181,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "as attacking!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 182,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "We pride ourselves in our"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 184,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 185,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "speed and quick dodges,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 186,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "but I am sure that at times you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 187,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "have realized while fighting that"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 188,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "despite the fact that our dodging"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 189,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "is superior, if we are hit once we are"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 190,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "serious danger."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 192,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 193,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "It is true that at times we"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 194,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "can view others as humorous as"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 195,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "we easily dodge their attacks."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 196,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "But if we are attacked by many at"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 197,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "once, you must remember that we"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 198,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "may not even have room to doge."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 200,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 201,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "You must make a quick decision"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 202,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "to flee. Most would flee immediately,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 203,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "but we don't need to."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 204,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "Even if we don't see an opening,"
    },
    {
