      "line" : 388,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "stones well, you can always buy"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 389,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "them from those who can."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 390,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "And if you can choose stones well,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 391,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "it could be very profitable for you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 392,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "What do you think? Do you like the idea?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 394,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 395,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "If you wish to master this skill,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 396,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "you will have to train quite a bit."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 397,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "The training also requires some items"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 398,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "that won't be easy to find. . ."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 399,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "Of course, I am sure it won't be"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 400,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "impossible with your skill . ."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 402,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 403,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "You will need two ^3355FF' Garlet '^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 404,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "and two ^3355FF' Scell '^000000 to start with."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 405,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "Make sure they are similar to stones"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 406,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "and able to be thrown. When you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 407,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "have gathered these items, I will be"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 408,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "happy to teach you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 411,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 412,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "It seems you are not very experienced. . ."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 413,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "We may need some more time to consider you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 417,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 418,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "Most thieves and assassins"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 419,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "have the basic skills to do"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 420,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "well at their job. However,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 421,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "the skills that I can teach them"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 422,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "cannot be learned anywhere else."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 423,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "If you every decide to"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 425,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "[Alcouskou]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 426,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "become a thief or assassin,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 427,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "or know someone who is,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 428,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "come to me or send them to me."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 429,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "These new skills should be"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 430,
      "npc" : "Alcouskou",
      "text" : "taught to all who want to learn them."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 435,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "[RuRumuni]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 436,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "I am a humble merchant here"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 437,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "in Payon. I buy the leather"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 438,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "hides of animals brought in by"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 439,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "the hunters and make leather"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 440,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "pouches to sell. I grew up"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 441,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "around leather working and am quite good at it."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 445,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "[RuRumuni]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 446,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "There is a thief guild in the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 447,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "area of Morocc. I know one there"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 448,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "that sends me thieves in need"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 449,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "of items I make such as a"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 450,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "^3355FF' Leather Bag of Infinity '^000000."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 451,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "They visit my store often."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 455,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "[RuRumuni]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 456,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "Ahhh... You have come for a leather bag."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 457,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "Very good, very good."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 458,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "I will make you the leather bag"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 459,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "right away if you wait just a bit."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 460,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "TuTak TuTak Shyuku Shyuku Shyuku"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 461,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "- - - - -"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 463,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "[RuRumuni]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 464,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "Okay, here it is all done."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 465,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "Take this leather bag"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 466,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "to the Thief guild's Alcouskou"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 467,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "If you take him this, he will"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 468,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "teach you the skill that you "
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 469,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "wish to learn."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 477,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "[RuRumuni]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 478,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "Find Alcouskou of the thief guild"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 479,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "to place and order for a leather bag of infinity."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 480,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "You should know that the leather bag of infinity"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 481,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "takes much time and skill to make."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 482,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "In order to make such an item, you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 483,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "must provide me with the materials."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 485,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "The items needed as materials are"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 486,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "these items. .."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 487,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "^3355FF' Earthworm Peeling '^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 488,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "^3355FF' Cobweb '^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 489,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "^3355FF' Cactus Needle '^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 490,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "I need one of each."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 493,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "[RuRumuni]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 494,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "Here is your leather bag of infinity."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 495,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "Take this to the Thief guilds"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 496,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "Alcouskou and let him know "
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 497,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "that you are now ready to learn"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 498,
      "npc" : "Bag Seller",
      "text" : "the skill."
    }
  ]
}